        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "56b5b330-d09b-38ef-8183-72f6b5105d01",
                "word": "nomophobie",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "cd8558c6-a805-4411-af0a-051c7872a35e",
                        "entry_id": "56b5b330-d09b-38ef-8183-72f6b5105d01",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "nomophobies"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f9bb4fb8-a65b-3acb-8d61-457c8fb76d90",
                        "entry_id": "56b5b330-d09b-38ef-8183-72f6b5105d01",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Méfiance envers les législations ; peur morbide des lois."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "264ee070-996d-41e6-a7e4-cae7f9ef1259",
                                "sense_id": "f9bb4fb8-a65b-3acb-8d61-457c8fb76d90",
                                "text": "Si par \"nomophobie\" More donne peu de lois à son île, l'usage y tient lieu de code qu'il eût sans doute été héroïque d'enfreindre : on imagine mal qu'un soupirant se soustraie à l'inspection pré-nuptiale, ou qu'une veuve se marie après avoir reçu l'ordination sacerdotale."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c7b3eb15-773d-4803-9465-a3879c834793",
                                "sense_id": "f9bb4fb8-a65b-3acb-8d61-457c8fb76d90",
                                "text": "Ainsi les textes dont nous avons présenté l'étude, et qui ne sont certes pas suspects de complaisance a priori pour l'état du Droit qu'ils réfléchissaient, ne donnent-ils jamais ni dans une nomophobie frontale, ni même dans ce que l'on pourrait appeler la crypto-nomophobie : ils ont bien mieux à faire, et nous croyons avoir pu le montrer."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b5b8ea5a-0e53-4982-ac6b-f7b0bf7d1a48",
                        "source_entry_id": "56b5b330-d09b-38ef-8183-72f6b5105d01",
                        "source_sense_id": "f9bb4fb8-a65b-3acb-8d61-457c8fb76d90",
                        "target_lang_word": "nomophobia",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "nomophobia",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5d88d996-9b34-3ea8-9394-35354dd02553",
                                        "entry_id": "acfe76fc-5fa0-3b42-94de-99588f2eb433",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A fear of or disdain for laws."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "15fd796f-53a3-4d5b-b546-3d285b992900",
                                                "sense_id": "5d88d996-9b34-3ea8-9394-35354dd02553",
                                                "text": "The persons of whom I speak have a terror of the very name and mention of the law. They are the morbid subjects of a kind of nomophobia, being in danger of going into fits at every allusion to it[...]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "06313c76-d7ff-4e5c-97f4-4cebcbc67e22",
                                                "sense_id": "5d88d996-9b34-3ea8-9394-35354dd02553",
                                                "text": "Seen in this light, his antisemitism appears in its ultimate essence as a nomophobia, a revolt against the divinely sanctioned moral law or, religiously speaking, a revolt against God."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f4617a93-4b93-47d2-9cf0-7405e3fe14f5",
                                                "sense_id": "5d88d996-9b34-3ea8-9394-35354dd02553",
                                                "text": "Despite the danger of the narrowing of discipleship to activism of some kind, the end result here is not acquiescence into Enlightenment autonomy. It is not what may be termed 'nomophobia' (neurotic fear of law or command) though much of that is about."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "nomophobia",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "35027c03-b884-37f9-8a94-08d18fd1218b",
                                        "entry_id": "f4e46717-205b-3237-8d90-615a94516355",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The fear of not having a functioning mobile phone."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "893f3dfd-5161-4ca0-baa0-e03372d915e9",
                                                "sense_id": "35027c03-b884-37f9-8a94-08d18fd1218b",
                                                "text": "There was a second article saying that people apparently suffered from Nomophobia – the fear of not having your mobile turned on – which in the Professor's opinion simply proved that they needed to get a life."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e90c5a9a-02d3-4628-9353-455892f6a083",
                                                "sense_id": "35027c03-b884-37f9-8a94-08d18fd1218b",
                                                "text": "Alektorophobia, like metrophobia (the fear of poetry) or the disorder nomophobia (the fear of being out of cell-phone contact), is completely irrational."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bfe916b0-1d47-407e-998b-7f89439cf535",
                                                "sense_id": "35027c03-b884-37f9-8a94-08d18fd1218b",
                                                "text": "AT&T, for example, has sought to turn “nomophobia”—a fear of being unable to communicate for lack of a cell phone—into a vehicle for sales; see Geoff Colvin, “Building a Super‐Brand— Superfast: What's the Secret of Survival These Days? Change Quickly, Says AT&T's Marketing Chief, Along with Your Customer,\" Fortune September 3, 2012, 60-64."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "a1ced703-35ae-3e37-968a-983b5f31dc74",
                "word": "nomophobie",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "6b66fdbc-8e5f-4056-b509-236d89c6d4c6",
                        "entry_id": "a1ced703-35ae-3e37-968a-983b5f31dc74",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "nomophobies"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "87ce1571-99df-39e0-8560-1811eb485bb2",
                        "entry_id": "a1ced703-35ae-3e37-968a-983b5f31dc74",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Peur morbide de ne pas avoir son téléphone portable."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "178e48ee-ada8-4a7e-89e0-8ab4ba9fc385",
                                "sense_id": "87ce1571-99df-39e0-8560-1811eb485bb2",
                                "text": "Dans le cas du mobile, la nomophobie est plutôt une gêne, une frustration, un désagrément, une complication dans la vie quotidienne. Cumulant tant de fonctions, le mobile est devenu indispensable, si bien qu'on envisage plus du tout de s'en passer, ne serait-ce qu'une journée."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ce12d031-2b21-4348-8a8f-755b52a6dda6",
                                "sense_id": "87ce1571-99df-39e0-8560-1811eb485bb2",
                                "text": "Le téléphone intelligent a investi notre quotidien au point d’engendrer une pathologie des temps modernes connue sous le nom de nomophobie."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a1bc89c8-6038-4059-ac51-4fb42c77328c",
                                "sense_id": "87ce1571-99df-39e0-8560-1811eb485bb2",
                                "text": "Les résultats de l'étude ont également montré un effet du genre et de l'ordre des naissances sur la nomophobie et les comportements de tricherie avec un smartphone."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
